{"seq":4,"slug":"result-builders","title":"Result Builders 结果构建器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/result-builders","wordCount":717,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"result-builders-结果构建器\">Result Builders 结果构建器</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Result Builders（结果构建器）是 Swift 5.4 引入的元编程特性（SE-0289），允许开发者通过声明式语法构建复杂的数据结构。SwiftUI 的 <code>@ViewBuilder</code> 是最知名的 Result Builder 应用。通过自定义 Result Builder，可以创建类型安全的领域特定语言（DSL），将命令式代码转换为声明式语法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    RB[&quot;@resultBuilder&quot;] --&gt; BB[&quot;buildBlock&quot;]&#10;    RB --&gt; BO[&quot;buildOptional&quot;]&#10;    RB --&gt; BE[&quot;buildEither&quot;]&#10;    RB --&gt; BA[&quot;buildArray&quot;]&#10;    RB --&gt; BF[&quot;buildFinalResult&quot;]&#10;    RB --&gt; BL[&quot;buildLimitedAvailability&quot;]&#10;    BB --&gt; DSL[&quot;自定义 DSL&quot;]&#10;    DSL --&gt; HTML[&quot;HTML Builder&quot;]&#10;    DSL --&gt; SQL[&quot;Query Builder&quot;]&#10;    DSL --&gt; UI[&quot;View Builder&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    RB[\"@resultBuilder\"] --&gt; BB[\"buildBlock\"]\n    RB --&gt; BO[\"buildOptional\"]\n    RB --&gt; BE[\"buildEither\"]\n    RB --&gt; BA[\"buildArray\"]\n    RB --&gt; BF[\"buildFinalResult\"]\n    RB --&gt; BL[\"buildLimitedAvailability\"]\n    BB --&gt; DSL[\"自定义 DSL\"]\n    DSL --&gt; HTML[\"HTML Builder\"]\n    DSL --&gt; SQL[\"Query Builder\"]\n    DSL --&gt; UI[\"View Builder\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Result Builder 是一种<strong>编译期元编程</strong>机制：你为某个类型标注 <code>@resultBuilder</code> 并实现一组静态 <code>build</code> 方法，编译器会把标注函数的声明式代码块<strong>自动改写</strong>为对这些 <code>build</code> 方法的调用。换句话说，它让「代码块的语法结构」变成可被自定义的输入，从而把命令式的多语句序列转成声明式 DSL。其核心是一组各司其职的构建方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>buildBlock</code></strong>——唯一必须实现的方法，把闭包中的多个语句组合成最终值；</li>\n<li><strong><code>buildExpression</code></strong>——当单个表达式的类型与组件类型不同时做转换；</li>\n<li><strong><code>buildOptional</code> / <code>buildEither</code></strong>——分别支撑 <code>if</code>（无 else）与 <code>if-else</code>/<code>switch</code>；</li>\n<li><strong><code>buildArray</code></strong>——支撑 <code>for-in</code> 循环；</li>\n<li><strong><code>buildFinalResult</code> / <code>buildLimitedAvailability</code></strong>——做最终结果转换与 <code>#available</code> 处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由于转换发生在编译时，DSL 在获得灵活语法的同时仍享有完整的类型检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本原理\">基本原理</h2><p><code>@resultBuilder</code> 标记的类型需要实现一组静态 <code>build</code> 方法，编译器会将声明式代码块自动转换为对这些方法的调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@resultBuilder&#10;struct ArrayBuilder&lt;Element&gt; {&#10;    static func buildBlock(_ components: Element...) -&gt; [Element] {&#10;        components&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@ArrayBuilder&lt;String&gt;&#10;func greetings() -&gt; [String] {&#10;    &quot;Hello&quot;&#10;    &quot;World&quot;&#10;    &quot;Swift&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@resultBuilder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArrayBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        components</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@ArrayBuilder&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greetings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"World\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Swift\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将 <code>greetings()</code> 的函数体转换为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func greetings() -&gt; [String] {&#10;    ArrayBuilder&lt;String&gt;.buildBlock(&quot;Hello&quot;, &quot;World&quot;, &quot;Swift&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greetings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ArrayBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buildBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"World\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Swift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"buildblock-基础组合\">buildBlock：基础组合</h2><p><code>buildBlock</code> 是唯一必须实现的方法，它接收闭包中每个语句的结果并组合成最终值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@resultBuilder&#10;struct HTMLBuilder {&#10;    static func buildBlock(_ components: HTMLNode...) -&gt; [HTMLNode] {&#10;        components&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;protocol HTMLNode {&#10;    func render() -&gt; String&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Text: HTMLNode {&#10;    let content: String&#10;    func render() -&gt; String { content }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Tag: HTMLNode {&#10;    let name: String&#10;    let children: [HTMLNode]&#10;&#10;    func render() -&gt; String {&#10;        let inner = children.map { $0.render() }.joined()&#10;        return &quot;&lt;\\(name)&gt;\\(inner)&lt;/\\(name)&gt;&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;func div(@HTMLBuilder content: () -&gt; [HTMLNode]) -&gt; Tag {&#10;    Tag(name: &quot;div&quot;, children: content())&#10;}&#10;&#10;func p(@HTMLBuilder content: () -&gt; [HTMLNode]) -&gt; Tag {&#10;    Tag(name: &quot;p&quot;, children: content())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@resultBuilder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buildBlock</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components: HTMLNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [HTMLNode] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        components</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLNode </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { content }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLNode </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children: [HTMLNode]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() }.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">joined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shik